@startuml "Inscription - Diagramme de séquence"

title Processus d'inscription utilisateur

actor "Utilisateur" as User
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Controller" as AuthCtrl
participant "Auth Service" as AuthSvc
participant "User Service" as UserSvc
participant "Email Service" as EmailSvc
participant "Redis Cache" as Redis
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Inscription ==
User -> Frontend: S'inscrire
activate Frontend
Frontend -> API: POST /api/auth/register
note right: Body: {email, password, name}
activate API

API -> AuthCtrl: register(userData)
activate AuthCtrl

AuthCtrl -> UserSvc: checkUserExists(email)
activate UserSvc
UserSvc -> DB: SELECT user WHERE email=?
activate DB
DB --> UserSvc: null (utilisateur n'existe pas)
deactivate DB
deactivate UserSvc

AuthCtrl -> AuthSvc: hashPassword(password)
activate AuthSvc
AuthSvc -> AuthSvc: bcrypt.hash(password, 12)
AuthSvc --> AuthCtrl: hashedPassword
deactivate AuthSvc

AuthCtrl -> UserSvc: createUser(userData)
activate UserSvc
UserSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO users (email, password, name, isVerified=false)
activate DB
DB --> UserSvc: user created
deactivate DB
deactivate UserSvc

AuthCtrl -> AuthSvc: generateEmailVerificationToken(userId)
activate AuthSvc
AuthSvc -> Redis: SET verify:{token} = userId (expire 24h)
activate Redis
Redis --> AuthSvc: token stored
deactivate Redis
AuthSvc --> AuthCtrl: verification token
deactivate AuthSvc

AuthCtrl -> EmailSvc: sendVerificationEmail(user, token)
activate EmailSvc
EmailSvc -> EmailSvc: Préparer email template
EmailSvc -> EmailSvc: Envoyer email SMTP
EmailSvc --> AuthCtrl: email sent
deactivate EmailSvc

AuthCtrl --> API: {message: "User created, check email"}
deactivate AuthCtrl
API --> Frontend: registration success
deactivate API
Frontend --> User: "Vérifiez votre email"
deactivate Frontend

note over User, DB
    L'utilisateur doit maintenant vérifier 
    son email avant de pouvoir se connecter
end note

@enduml